 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "Thamud, Salih, the she-camel and the blast are never drawn; a mountain plate for «ينحتون من الجبال بيوتا» leaves before the blast. 84 and 85:1-8 keep «فما…» and «وما… إلا» whole. Not glossed: 85:9-11 (the tafsirs' wording repeats Quran phrases), 87 «سبعا من المثاني» (Al-Muyassar: al-Fatiha; As-Sa'di: the seven long surahs, or al-Fatiha). 85:12-14, 88 and 89 address the Prophet ﷺ: no plate starts on them; the book for «والقرآن العظيم» leaves before 88. Stars for the heavens and the earth, an hourglass for «وإن الساعة لآتية» (the Hour is not drawn), geometric for «إن ربك»."
 },
